iv id=3D"_R_3pmmpbsnpfiv9lb_" class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__cont=
ent" inert=3D""><div class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__body text-bod=
y-2"><p>You can access Claude Code with a Claude Pro or Max plan, a Team or=
 Enterprise plan, or a Claude Console account. <a href=3D"https://code.clau=
de.com/docs/en/overview" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" data=
-cta-position=3D"faq" data-cta-url=3D"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/overv=
iew">Download Claude Code</a> and sign in with your respective Claude or Co=
nsole credentials.</p></div></div></div><div class=3D"Faq-module-scss-modul=
e__XHzreq__item"><h3 class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__heading"><but=
ton type=3D"button" class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__trigger" aria-=
expanded=3D"false" aria-controls=3D"_R_5pmmpbsnpfiv9lb_" data-cta-ignore=3D=
""><span class=3D"text-headline-6-serif">What kind of tasks can Claude Code=
 handle?</span><span class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__icon" aria-hi=
dden=3D"true"><span class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__iconBar"></spa=
n><span class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__iconBarVertical"></span></=
span></button></h3><div id=3D"_R_5pmmpbsnpfiv9lb_" class=3D"Faq-module-scss=
-module__XHzreq__content" inert=3D""><div class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__=
XHzreq__body text-body-2"><p>Claude Code can handle routine work like bug f=
ixes and testing, and larger jobs like refactors and new features that are =
long-running and asynchronous.</p><p>You set the direction as the architect=
 and orchestrator, and Claude Code does the work. Describe what you want an=
d it plans, writes code, runs tests, and opens pull requests. It can work o=
n several tasks at once, and surface decisions you need to make for it to k=
eep going.</p></div></div></div><div class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzre=
q__item"><h3 class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__heading"><button type=
=3D"button" class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__trigger" aria-expanded=
=3D"false" aria-controls=3D"_R_7pmmpbsnpfiv9lb_" data-cta-ignore=3D""><span=
 class=3D"text-headline-6-serif">How does Claude Code work with my existing=
 tools?</span><span class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__icon" aria-hid=
den=3D"true"><span class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__iconBar"></span=
><span class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__iconBarVertical"></span></s=
pan></button></h3><div id=3D"_R_7pmmpbsnpfiv9lb_" class=3D"Faq-module-scss-=
module__XHzreq__content" inert=3D""><div class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__X=
Hzreq__body text-body-2"><p>Claude Code runs in your terminal and works alo=
ngside your preferred IDE and development tools without requiring you to ch=
ange your workflow. Claude Code can also use command line tools (like Git) =
and MCP servers (like GitHub) to extend its own capabilities using your too=
ls.</p></div></div></div><div class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__item=
"><h3 class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__heading"><button type=3D"but=
ton" class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__trigger" aria-expanded=3D"fal=
se" aria-controls=3D"_R_9pmmpbsnpfiv9lb_" data-cta-ignore=3D""><span class=
=3D"text-headline-6-serif">Is Claude Code secure?</span><span class=3D"Faq-=
module-scss-module__XHzreq__icon" aria-hidden=3D"true"><span class=3D"Faq-m=
odule-scss-module__XHzreq__iconBar"></span><span class=3D"Faq-module-scss-m=
odule__XHzreq__iconBarVertical"></span></span></button></h3><div id=3D"_R_9=
pmmpbsnpfiv9lb_" class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__content" inert=3D=
""><div class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__body text-body-2"><p>Yes. =
Claude Code runs locally in your terminal and talks directly to model APIs =
without requiring a backend server or remote code index. It also asks for p=
ermission before making changes to your files or running commands.</p></div=
></div></div><div class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__item"><h3 class=
=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__heading"><button type=3D"button" class=
=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__trigger" aria-expanded=3D"false" aria-c=
ontrols=3D"_R_bpmmpbsnpfiv9lb_" data-cta-ignore=3D""><span class=3D"text-he=
adline-6-serif">What are the system requirements to run Claude Code?</span>=
<span class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__icon" aria-hidden=3D"true"><=
span class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__iconBar"></span><span class=
=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__iconBarVertical"></span></span></button=
></h3><div id=3D"_R_bpmmpbsnpfiv9lb_" class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzr=
eq__content" inert=3D""><div class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__body =
text-body-2"><p>Claude Code works on macOS, Linux, and Windows. <a href=3D"=
https://code.claude.com/docs/en/setup#system-requirements" target=3D"_blank=
" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" data-cta-position=3D"faq" data-cta-url=3D"htt=
ps://code.claude.com/docs/en/setup#system-requirements">See full system req=
uirements</a>.</p></div></div></div><div class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__X=
Hzreq__item"><h3 class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__heading"><button =
type=3D"button" class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__trigger" aria-expa=
nded=3D"false" aria-controls=3D"_R_dpmmpbsnpfiv9lb_" data-cta-ignore=3D""><=
span class=3D"text-headline-6-serif">How much does Claude Code cost?</span>=
<span class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__icon" aria-hidden=3D"true"><=
span class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__iconBar"></span><span class=
=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__iconBarVertical"></span></span></button=
></h3><div id=3D"_R_dpmmpbsnpfiv9lb_" class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzr=
eq__content" inert=3D""><div class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__body =
text-body-2"><p>When used with a Claude Console account, Claude Code consum=
es API tokens at <a href=3D"https://claude.com/pricing#api" target=3D"_blan=
k" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" data-cta-position=3D"faq" data-cta-url=3D"ht=
tps://claude.com/pricing#api">standard API pricing</a>.</p></div></div></di=
v><div class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__item"><h3 class=3D"Faq-modu=
