><span class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__XHzreq__iconBarVertical"></span></s=
pan></button></h3><div id=3D"_R_hpmmpbsnpfiv9lb_" class=3D"Faq-module-scss-=
module__XHzreq__content" inert=3D""><div class=3D"Faq-module-scss-module__X=
Hzreq__body text-body-2"><p>Fast mode is a high-speed configuration for Opu=
s 5.5, making the model 2.5x faster at a higher cost per token. Fast mode i=
s available:</p><ul><li>In research preview on Claude Code, and is priced a=
t $8/$40 per million tokens.</li><li>On consumption-based plans.</li><li>Vi=
a usage credits for users on subscription plans.</li></ul></div></div></div=
